Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Vulkan: propagate AS creation failures and cache BLAS address
Base: Godot cafc17a192acf67903910a68aeb3c076c0907a4b

Use the actual Vulkan BLAS address, reject failed creation, and clean up owned
resources. The tracked-buffer allocation cleanup also affects non-AS buffers.
Exact-source patch; compilation and native Vulkan validation remain required.

